 "comment": "Individual entity, so the s.40(b) rule is closed. Person A (son of the proprietor) has all five vocabulary natures moving: salary, rent, interest and purchases positive, other negative (a receipt credited to its ledger), each giving one comparable_required finding with its own comparable text. Person B is recorded as \"partner\" but the entity's rules leave the s.40(b) rule closed, so salary and interest also ask for a comparable. Person A's commission nature is outside the vocabulary and moves without a finding. One rent payment has an empty voucher number and a voucher type other than its base type, which the finding's evidence label carries over from the amount figure. Salary is also listed as a payable nature, which only related_parties_cl23 reads.",
